A||||5||GT Bastard||Fiero GT vs. Pedestrian||||14||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||04-24-2000||01:54 PM||||So I was sitting at a light on my way to work... I look to my right, and I see a guy in shorts and a tank top with running shoes.  He's standing at the crosswalk waiting to cross the same street that I'm crossing.  I rolled down my window and asked him if he wanted to race.  He said, "sure b*tch."  Before the light turned green, I gave it a couple of good 'revs' and then hit it!  I think he got the jump on me because he launched pretty hard (musta had Nike shoes.)  No worries though, because I began to pull away from him when I hit third gear at about 70 mph through a school zone.  Whew, that was a close one.  Score one for the Fiero!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
